                            <div id="content" class="content" role="main" itemprop="mainContentOfPage">

                                <h1 class="entry-title" itemprop="headline">Edição para Intersolar Summit Brasil Nordeste 2025</h1>

                                <div class="entry-content">
                                                                        <p>Por ocasião da Intersolar Summit Brasil Nordeste 2025, o <strong>pv magazine</strong> publica uma edição especial sobre os últimos avanços no mercado fotovoltaico brasileiro.</p>
<p><a href="https://player.flipsnack.com/?hash=NTg4QTVBREVGQjUremszeWt0MTZyaA==" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Prévia</a></p>
<p><img fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" class="wp-image-55831 alignleft" src="https://www.pv-magazine-brasil.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/13/2025/04/SE-ISBrazil2025-Title_h1697px_72dpi-566x800.png" alt="Special Edition Intersolar Nordeste 2025" width="229" height="324" srcset="https://www.pv-magazine-brasil.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/13/2025/04/SE-ISBrazil2025-Title_h1697px_72dpi-566x800.png 566w, https://www.pv-magazine-brasil.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/13/2025/04/SE-ISBrazil2025-Title_h1697px_72dpi-724x1024.png 724w, https://www.pv-magazine-brasil.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/13/2025/04/SE-ISBrazil2025-Title_h1697px_72dpi-768x1086.png 768w, https://www.pv-magazine-brasil.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/13/2025/04/SE-ISBrazil2025-Title_h1697px_72dpi-1086x1536.png 1086w, https://www.pv-magazine-brasil.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/13/2025/04/SE-ISBrazil2025-Title_h1697px_72dpi.png 1200w" sizes="(max-width: 229px) 100vw, 229px" /></p>
<h2>2025: Uma restrição, diversas soluções</h2>
<p>Abril 2025 &#8211; Edición en portugués</p>
<p>Tópicos:</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>BESS as a Service:</strong> <span class="TextRun SCXW258927926 BCX2" lang="PT-BR" xml:lang="PT-BR" data-contrast="none"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW258927926 BCX2">mais empresas oferecem sistemas de armazenamento como um serviço para consumidores comerciais e industriais, aposta que elimina a necessidade de investimento inicial do cliente. </span></span></li>
<li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="2" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" aria-setsize="-1" data-aria-posinset="2" data-aria-level="1"><b><span data-contrast="none">O futuro da energia solar no agro: </span></b><span data-contrast="none">como arranjos agrovoltaicos podem ampliar o atendimento ao agronegócio e as iniciativas brasileiras. </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279,&quot;335559991&quot;:360}"> </span></li>
<li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="2" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" aria-setsize="-1" data-aria-posinset="3" data-aria-level="1"><b><span data-contrast="none">Como e quando hibridizar sistemas fotovoltaicos: </span></b><span data-contrast="none">especialistas dão dicas de como avaliar a oportunidade de investimentos em solar e bateria</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279,&quot;335559991&quot;:360}"> </span></li>
<li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="2" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" aria-setsize="-1" data-aria-posinset="4" data-aria-level="1"><b><span data-contrast="none">Leilões para baterias: </span></b><span data-contrast="none">as expectativas em torno das concorrências que podem destravar projetos na escala dos GW</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279,&quot;335559991&quot;:360}"> </span></li>
<li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="2" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" aria-setsize="-1" data-aria-posinset="5" data-aria-level="1"><b><span data-contrast="none">E mais!</span></b><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279,&quot;335559991&quot;:360}"> </span></li>
</ul>
<p style="text-align: center;">
<p>&nbsp;</p>

